  << /ActualText (UI\057UX Designer with 20\053 projects and 90\053 screens designed across SaaS dashboards\054 web apps\054 landing pages\054 and product interfaces\056 Experienced in user research\054 wireframing\054 prototyping\054 and design systems\054 with a UI\057UX internship at Memolane where I turned user research into a prioritized feature plan and high\055fidelity designs\056 Hands\055on frontend skills \050HTML\054 CSS\054 JavaScript\051 help me design interfaces that are practical to build and hand off to developers\056)
