1331 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UI\057UX Design Intern\240 \174\240 Memolane \050Neo Labs\051\240 \174\240 Apr 2026 \023 July 2026\nResearched 10\02312 journaling apps and surveyed 20\053 users\054 finding that most apps push premium access too early\054 then mapped the user journey and prioritized the feature list \050streaks\054 mood tracking\054 reflection prompts\054 recall notifications\051\056\nDesigned wireframes\054 prototypes\054 and high\055fidelity screens in Figma from concept to developer handoff\054 including a scoring feature based on the research findings\056\nEstablished reusable UI patterns for visual consistency and collaborated with developers and stakeholders in design reviews\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 1332 0 R
     /Pg 1309 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
