1335 0 obj
  << /ActualText (AI\055Powered Amazon Creative SaaS\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design \174 Figma\nDesigned a 10\055screen SaaS interface concept for an AI platform that helps Amazon sellers generate product creatives\056\nStructured multi\055step AI workflows into clear\054 scalable navigation and dashboards\054 translating a complex backend process into a simple user\055facing experience\056\n\nNova Chat\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design \174 Figma \nDesigned a 19\055screen agent\055side dashboard for a customer support chat app where AI handles first\055line chats and hands off to human agents\054 adding AI labels to show which chats are handled by AI and which by agents\056\nIntroduced a Take Over Chat button so agents can step into AI\055handled chats when answers fall short\054 and designed the escalation flow where a customer\047s agent request triggers a pop\055up alert on the agent dashboard\056\n\nEmployee Leave Management System\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design \174 Figma\nDesigned a dashboard for managing employee leave requests\054 records\054 and admin workflows\056 \nBuilt consistent UI patterns across 16 interconnected screens\054 reducing navigation friction for HR admins and employees\056\n\nStudent Course Enrollment App\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design \174 Figma\nDesigned a 21\055screen course enrollment app covering course listing with filters and sorting\054 course details with add to schedule and enroll actions\054 and a visual weekly timetable preview of selected courses\056\nDesigned conflict detection that highlights clashing courses and lets students resolve them by removing courses from their selection\054 followed by enrollment confirmation and success screens\056\n\nPersonal Portfolio Websites\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design \046 Frontend Development \174 Figma\054 Framer\054 HTML\057CSS\057JS\nDesigned a portfolio in Figma and developed it with HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\054 including a working contact form \050Formspree\051\054 responsive layouts across breakpoints\054 and Netlify deployment\056\nDesigned and built a second portfolio in Framer with a featured projects section\054 case\055study pages\054 a skills section\054 and a contact form\054 presenting the same work in a different visual style\056\n\n30 JavaScript Projects Collection\240 \024\240 Frontend Development \174 HTML\054 CSS\054 JavaScript\054 REST APIs\nBuilding 30 interactive JavaScript projects\073 12 completed so far\054 including a weather app with API integration\054 expense tracker\054 notes app\054 QR code generator\054 and text\055to\055speech converter\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1336 0 R
     /Pg 1309 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

